cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Hephaestus in your research, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: Hephaestus
abstract: >-
  Hephaestus helps software teams put good engineering practices into their everyday work. It
  reviews pull requests, issues, code reviews and team discussions as the work happens, and gives
  each person feedback that cites their work and names a next step. Feedback appears on the work
  while it is still open, in a weekly digest, and on each person's Practice profile, which shows how
  each practice develops over time. Work drafted with a coding agent gets the same feedback.
authors:
  - name: TUM Applied Education Technologies
    website: https://aet.cit.tum.de/
repository-code: https://github.com/hephaestus-build/Hephaestus
url: https://hephaestus.build
license: MIT
keywords:
  - practice-feedback
  - engineering-practices
  - developer-feedback
  - self-hosted
